<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλκαρ</span></b> , τό, only nom.
		and acc.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>safeguard,
				defence</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔδε τί σε Τρώεσσιν ὀΐομαι ἄ.
					ἔσεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.644
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.823
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾶς δάμαρτος ἄ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					590
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): c. gen. obj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήραος
			ἄ</span>. <i>defence against</i> old age, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				193
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴδεος, ὑετοῦ ἄ.</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				124
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1074
			</span></i>: abs., <i>remedy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			 and Lyr. word, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				10.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				128
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέξω</span>.</div>
